                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3d279bf1-5d27-32ae-a979-59245384f43d",
                        "entry_id": "a734fb7e-17ff-34b1-91e1-27bd062258f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A stupid, foolish person; a simpleton; a dunce."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "regional"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89fd2da1-b039-415a-9311-6eb6a02e59fe",
                                "sense_id": "3d279bf1-5d27-32ae-a979-59245384f43d",
                                "text": "I daresay I made a gaby of myself to the world"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "574154ea-7da4-4791-adbd-d67e04bd545b",
                                "sense_id": "3d279bf1-5d27-32ae-a979-59245384f43d",
                                "text": "His wrath, then, was proportionately violent when he was aware of two boys, who stopped close by him, and one of whom, a fat gaby of a fellow, pointed at him and called him \"Young mammy-sick!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "78d403fb-73ae-41c4-a67d-3da9204fe8b8",
                                "sense_id": "3d279bf1-5d27-32ae-a979-59245384f43d",
                                "text": "\"[Y]ou're a jobbernowl and a doodle, a maundering mooncalf and a blockheaded numps, a gaby and a loon; you're a Hatter!\" I shrieked the last epithet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ca6120e-4996-4e6f-afa0-51483a44cf79",
                                "sense_id": "3d279bf1-5d27-32ae-a979-59245384f43d",
                                "text": "\"You pair of gabeys!\" she exclaimed. \"You'll see him before the night's out.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
